<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-mth T-bill yield rises to 22.08 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-mth T-bill yield rises to 22.08 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.08 percent on Wednesday, up from 22.01 percent at auction three weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	   5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received    5,939.38 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	  5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.08 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.7823 pct</p>
</text>
